US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">We are pleased to inform you of\n2026&nbsp;</span><b style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">K-GKS (K-Global Korea\nScholarship)</b><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> Guidelines for Master’s candidates here in Gyeongsangbuk-do, Korea.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">As the one and only national\nengineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate\ncandidates up to 5 for this K-GKS admission. This might be a great opportunity\nfor you to be able to study in Korea with a full regional government\nscholarship and to settle down with decent jobs supported by Gyeongsangbuk-do\nand KIT.</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">Please see attached for further\ninformation and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please\nsend me&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red\">one\noriginal application document package by post(or in person) no later than April\n17th, (Friday), 2026</span></b></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">.\nYour original application documents must be delivered to my office by the\ndeadline. No online application is available. School does NOT accept overdue documents. </span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;nanum gothic&quot;;color:#212121\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\">1.&nbsp;Scholarship\nDuration<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;word-break:break-hangul\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_Hlk98745578\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#212121\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"603\" style=\"width:452.6pt;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-overlap:never;\n mso-yfti-tbllook:1184\">\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:6.5pt\">\n  <td width=\"207\" style=\"width:155.3pt;border-top:solid black 2.25pt;border-left:\n  none;border-bottom:double black 2.25pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid black 2.25pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:do